# 5.6 after a replug DP stays disconnected: Monado is blocked on display.dp1, no start and no budget, until the drm
# uevent shows it connected.
start desk
at 10 down usb.hid usb.cam usb.eye display.dp1
expect 17 ran stop-subtree monado
at 100 up usb.hid usb.cam usb.eye
expect 150 health monado blocked
expect 150 runs 1
at 200 up display.dp1
expect 205 ran start monado
